{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Obsessive Shadow",
    "steam_appid": 2074360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074360/extras/2711d02dd273e8943f3077cf859710cc.avif?t=1751737078\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Obsessive Shadow, you take on the role of Liam, a 9-year-old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">boy left alone in his home after the power suddenly goes out, plunging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the house into suffocating darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with only a flashlight, you must navigate the unsettling dangers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">of the night as you are being watched throughout the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mother's voice on the phone is your guide to surviving,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But as her instructions grow more confusing and the unease deepens,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the safety of her words begins to feel increasingly fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is watching, a shadowy figure moving just out of sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">waiting for you to slip up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the hours creep forward, the once-familiar home becomes an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unfamiliar labyrinth of fear, each corner hiding the possibility of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">confrontation with the lurking entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Testing your courage and instincts as you struggle to stay one step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ahead of the unseen threat. Your mother's voice remains your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lifeline,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but survival demands more than just following her instructions\u2014it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">requires vigilance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">quick thinking, and a determination to face the overwhelming dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you endure the relentless terror and make it to morning, or will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the suffocating darkness claim you before dawn?<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Created by</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pablo Heckman </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074360/extras/2711d02dd273e8943f3077cf859710cc.avif?t=1751737078\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Obsessive Shadow, you take on the role of Liam, a 9-year-old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">boy left alone in his home after the power suddenly goes out, plunging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the house into suffocating darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with only a flashlight, you must navigate the unsettling dangers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">of the night as you are being watched throughout the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mother's voice on the phone is your guide to surviving,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But as her instructions grow more confusing and the unease deepens,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the safety of her words begins to feel increasingly fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is watching, a shadowy figure moving just out of sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">waiting for you to slip up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the hours creep forward, the once-familiar home becomes an</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unfamiliar labyrinth of fear, each corner hiding the possibility of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">confrontation with the lurking entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Testing your courage and instincts as you struggle to stay one step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ahead of the unseen threat. Your mother's voice remains your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lifeline,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but survival demands more than just following her instructions\u2014it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">requires vigilance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">quick thinking, and a determination to face the overwhelming dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you endure the relentless terror and make it to morning, or will</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the suffocating darkness claim you before dawn?<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Created by</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pablo Heckman </strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The Obsessive Shadow is a Survival Horror Game about a stalker you can't exactly Identify. With nothing but your eyes and a flashlight at your disposal, it's up to you to survive whatever horrific person or thing is out there watching you...",
